Read the complete pinned client request and packet without producer concepts, self-inspections, selection reasons, peer reviews, or earlier raw results. View every exact supplied source asset and read applicable protected-layout manifests first. View all five members in packet order, each at native/use/thumbnail: complete all fifteen poster views before beginning the first copy-reading/transcription stage or any judgment/score. Record the actual first raw reading of every supplied copy entry, once in packet order; never fill it from required text, normalize it in place, or infer invisible scene/text from intent. All ten strings of this request must be represented in each member's compact copy array. Do not presume printable copy from internal group names, field labels, or production explanation.

